WEBVTT

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:18.330
Oh, this is very nice!

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:22.620
Why <i>do</i> you have those
marvelous dog ears, anyway?

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.500
Well...

00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:30.750
...and here I am.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.870
I can appreciate that guy's taste.

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:39.120
I was planning on visiting Alejandro's shop,
but with these ears...

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:42.620
I wouldn't worry about it.

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:48.000
It's not <i>that</i> startling for a Master
to suddenly grow animal ears.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:53.160
Will you look at that! Welcome, Ray, welcome!

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:56.160
Hello, Alejandro.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:01:00.620
I guess Marie is right:
I shouldn't have worried.

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.330
I just hope I don't run into Rook and--

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Yoo-hoo!

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.750
Good morning, Ray, Nemesis.

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:10.200
Is this the dog-ears curse?

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:13.870
The Miasmaflame Bracers may be cursed equipment.

00:01:13.870 --> 00:01:16.910
Ray, about those flattering ears of yours...

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:19.080
Blah, blah, blah, yadda yadda yadda,
etcetera, etcetera, etcetera...

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:20.500
That's hardly an explanation.

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:25.500
Ah, so a mysterious stranger
tricked you into drinking poison.

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:27.370
He got that?!

00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:29.250
Are you psychic or something?

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:33.450
It's not ESP or anything.
Just simple mind-reading.

00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:36.790
M-My identity...

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:42.200
Hey, Rook, that's a snazzy
silver coat you have there.

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:46.450
Yep--I've taken a liking to Liz, too.

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:51.700
Hmm? It moved. Was it the wind?

00:01:55.540 --> 00:01:58.200
Okay, I'll take this one!

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:02.950
Rook's coat is so awesome,
I just kind of gravitated to a coat, too.

00:02:02.950 --> 00:02:06.040
Do you have <i>any</i> autonomy at all?

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:09.080
Quit reading my mind, would you?

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:10.580
Huh?

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:12.620
What in blazes?

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:18.200
A <i>gacha</i> machine?

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:51.250
We should be fine here.

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:53.450
"Chapter 5: 
La Porte de l'Enfer"

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:55.250
If only it came with a reward
of 200 thousand-plus lir.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:56.620
After all...

00:03:56.620 --> 00:03:59.450
You spent 100 thousand lir on gacha-- <i>twice</i> .

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:02.040
And the first one was a Tomb Labyrinth--

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:06.500
No! Stop! Don't remind me!

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:10.450
Rook hit it big, compared to you.

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:17.750
I can't believe he won a piece
of special UBM armor...

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:17.750
"UBM Touch of the Silencer, Veltboule"

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:19.870
What's wrong with me?

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:23.500
I mean, the staff <i>said</i> they'd
never seen any X-rank capsules!

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:31.870
Whoa!

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:38.910
"Item: Prism Steed, Zephyrus Silver"
"Special Item: Riding Equipment"

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:38.910
Zephyrus Silver... Looks like riding equipment.

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:42.910
Shall we ride, then?

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:45.080
Hup!

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:49.700
Ooh!

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:51.330
Be careful.

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:54.500
Right! Hi-yo, Silver!

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:00.370
Poke, poke.

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:00.370
Yeah, I'm alive.

00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:02.120
Good thing we're on grass.

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:03.500
Poke, poke.

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:03.500
Stop that!

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:08.830
You're a Paladin. It should stand to
reason that you can ride a horse.

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:10.620
That's what <i>I</i> thought.

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:14.120
"Running: A skill that lets Silver be ridden."
"Users must have the [Horse Riding Skill]
or [Riding] Skill."

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:14.120
But I don't have the Horse Riding skill.

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:19.200
Odd, seeing that a Paladin
is essentially an upgraded Knight.

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:21.790
An upgraded--

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:24.910
I've got to look something up.
Let me just log out for a sec.

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:26.910
"- <i>gram</i> Walkthrough Site"

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:33.500
I knew it. I should have learned
Horse Riding as a low-rank Knight.

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:40.250
Hmm, so this Amulet of the
Equestrian Tribe will let me learn it.

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:42.910
How much will <i>that</i> cost me?

00:05:42.910 --> 00:05:45.910
"100 thousand lir"

00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:45.910
A hundred thousand...

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:52.250
So I've got to start making money.

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:54.000
What about an arena?

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:58.160
You can fight all you want with no penalty
for dying, and there's prize money, too.

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:03.870
Yeah, but you need a total level
of at least 51 to participate.

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:06.450
I know: I'll bet on the fights! And that way--

00:06:06.450 --> 00:06:09.450
Please don't. You are terribly unlucky.

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:12.080
Right. Slow and steady it is, then.

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:13.790
Oh, please!

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:16.500
Did you bring the cash?

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:20.080
I scraped up just enough!
Please, give me back my brother!

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:24.750
Ha! Yeah, right!
He's gonna be our boss's dinner!

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:27.370
And you? You're gonna be <i>our</i> dinner!

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:30.500
Talk about your generic bad guys.

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:31.910
What do we do?

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:35.660
Passing them up would leave
a bad taste in my mouth, so...

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:37.950
--Stop right there!
--Stop right there!

00:06:37.950 --> 00:06:40.120
Did my voice just... double?

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:42.330
You there! You ruffians!

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:46.250
Remove your hands from the lady at once!

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:48.830
Help me!

00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:52.950
But of course. The fairest flower has its thorn.

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:58.200
It's my mission in life to be the thorn
for ladies as lovely as you...

00:06:58.200 --> 00:06:59.870
...and pierce any scoundrels.

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:02.700
Who the hell are <i>you</i> ?

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:05.500
My total level is 126.

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:06.950
Say what?

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:10.200
Behold my might!

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:12.830
--Now!
--Get him!

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:16.500
W-Wait! I haven't taken out my Magingear--

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:19.080
Now's your chance!

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:21.120
Thank you!

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:25.160
Huh?

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:29.330
What?! Total level 126,
and he went down just like <i>that</i> ?

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:31.330
Next?

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:33.830
You!

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:44.580
Wait--how--?

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:46.950
Nemesis, was that you?

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:55.290
Oh! The Miasmaflame Bracers
boost my STR by 100%!

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:56.910
Whoops!

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:00.910
Thank God he's alive.

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:02.790
All right...

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:04.950
Who's next?

00:08:05.870 --> 00:08:07.620
You'll regret this!

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:12.120
We've got her little brother, y'know!

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:13.660
First Heal!

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:18.000
Are you all right?

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:19.200
Thank you.

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:22.120
Hmm? Your ears...

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:23.410
What about them?

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:26.330
They're a neat accessory.

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:30.120
Look for a penguin guy--
he'll give you your own pair.

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:31.870
I'll remember that.

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:38.040
My name is Hugo Lesseps, Master and High Driver.

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:41.540
I'm Ray Starling, Master and Paladin.

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:43.790
This is my Embryo, Nemesis.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:47.250
I see. A Maiden type--very rare.

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:50.580
A pleasure, fair mademoiselle.

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:51.620
Mmm-hmm.

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:56.040
Say, if your levels are so high,
how'd you get so beat up?

00:08:56.040 --> 00:09:03.250
A quirk of my job: My physical stats
are nearly all at their starting values!

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:06.790
Um...

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:09.080
Thank you for what you did back there.

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:11.870
It's nothing. I felt like helping, that's all.

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:15.410
I take it you're Masters.
Might I ask you a favor?

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:19.160
Please--please save my younger brother!

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:21.700
Milady... lift your head.

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:24.910
Save him? You mean, from those bandits?

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:28.040
Yes. The Gouz-Maise Gang abducts children.

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:32.000
If the ransom isn't paid,
the children are killed and...

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:34.500
...and eat--

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:40.330
Please: If you save my brother,
this money is yours!

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:43.160
And if it's not enough, I'll do anything at all!

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:48.580
I accept--free of charge. What about you, Hugo?

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:49.950
A foolish question.

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:52.620
Thank you... so much.

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:58.290
Milady. We will wipe your tears.

00:09:58.290 --> 00:10:04.750
This I promise:
You will greet tomorrow with a smile.

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:29.950
Shorry for the wait, Hugo.

00:10:29.950 --> 00:10:32.580
She took them all down?

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:34.040
Huh?

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:35.540
A crest...

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:37.790
Ah, so she's a Master.

00:10:37.790 --> 00:10:40.200
Well done, Cyco.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.620
It was easy. They were nobodies.

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:46.120
Om-nom-nom. Gulp.

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:49.580
I interrogated them;
they said where their hideout is.

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:52.870
It's in the Cruella Mountain Belt.

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:58.870
So the chivalrous Hugo
brought along a loli-lover?

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:00.910
--Who are you calling a loli-lover?!
--Who are you calling a loli?!

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:07.000
That flat chest and short stature...
Hallmarks of a loli, to be sure.

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:11.540
And who else would have a loli
serve him but a loli-lover?

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:17.160
No! My form and design are all
about beauty, nothing more!

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:22.950
A Master of an Embryo who calls
that "beauty" is a loli-lover for certain.

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:24.620
I'm innocent!

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:26.660
Why, you... Now you've done it!

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:28.250
Come on, then.

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:34.660
Who <i>is</i> that monotone-talker, anyway?

00:11:34.660 --> 00:11:37.080
Cyco. My--

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:39.950
My party member.

00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:42.370
Her tongue is sharp, but she is quite reliable.

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:46.080
Where'd <i>that</i> come from?

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:55.290
Triggered level 8 quest: Rescue Roddy Lancarse.

00:11:55.290 --> 00:11:59.040
Come, then, Ray. Our mission awaits.

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:00.250
Okie-doke.

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:03.290
Begin quest!

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:09.000
This spot will do.

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:16.540
What's this?

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:22.000
Machinery?

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:25.450
Hugo, are you--?

00:12:25.450 --> 00:12:28.370
Why are you doing this quest, Ray?

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:33.660
Is it because you're a Paladin of the kingdom?
Or because you're your own man?

00:12:33.660 --> 00:12:36.910
Because it wouldn't sit right
with me if I let it slide.

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:39.830
My position never entered into it.

00:12:39.830 --> 00:12:41.540
Same here.

00:12:56.040 --> 00:13:00.080
Magingear... The main weapon
of the Dryfe Imperium.

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:02.000
Hugo!

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:06.580
I am but a single knight, fighting for a lady.

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:09.450
Isn't that right, my fellow knight?

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:10.790
Yeah.

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:17.040
Demi-Dragon-rank Magingear: Marshal II.

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:18.370
Sortie!

00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:25.790
Should we rush the place together?

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:28.580
If the kids are taken hostage, it's all over.

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:30.500
I have an idea.

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:31.450
You do?

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:34.250
This here is well known as Dryfe weaponry.

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:38.750
A nation with no reason to come
rescue the kingdom's children.

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:40.500
Oh, I get it.

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:44.620
If I were to attack the fort,
they wouldn't use the children against me.

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:48.620
To waste hostages on a disinterested foe
would only reduce the potential for more ransom.

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:53.000
Plus, they would no doubt
approach me to counter-attack.

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:56.160
That's when you sneak into the fort
and rescue the children.

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:57.290
Got it.

00:13:57.290 --> 00:14:03.000
My Smoke Discharger will cloud their vision.
You'll move within that smoke.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:04.290
Cyco, use Enemy Detect.

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:06.700
<i>Oui</i> , Ma-- <i>m'sieur</i> .

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:09.500
We need speed and precision.

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:13.250
We can't fail--not as long as
children's lives are at stake.

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:18.290
Aren't you a Maiden Master, too, Ray?

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:19.910
Why do you ask?

00:14:19.910 --> 00:14:23.660
Do you know what so many
Maiden Masters have in common?

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:25.370
In common?

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:27.250
According to an acquaintance of mine,

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:32.540
Maiden Masters don't think of
<i>Infinite Dendrogram</i> as a game.

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:34.910
Don't be ridiculous. I <i>know</i> it's a game!

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:36.750
That acquaintance said so, too.

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:41.290
But deep inside, they don't
believe it. Which is why...

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:43.370
Why what?

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:44.950
Never mind.

00:14:44.950 --> 00:14:48.700
Forgive me for saying such strange
things as we prepare our attack.

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:55.370
Oh: It's not a crime to kill tians if they're
criminals or if it's in self-defense.

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:56.500
Remember that.

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:57.620
I will.

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:59.290
Master, look.

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:04.040
Did they kidnap more kids?

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:06.200
They're talking about something.

00:15:07.660 --> 00:15:09.790
"Once we get back to the fort"...

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:15.500
..."kill... brats... payback...
buddies... caught."

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:19.080
There'll be no stay of execution,
it seems. On with the plan!

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:20.450
--Right!
--Yes, sir!

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:27.750
We're under attack!

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:29.870
Smoke Discharger!

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:36.370
Come on, Nemesis!

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:37.450
I've got this!

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:39.330
We'll save you!

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:45.750
Master...

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:50.160
Right. I know that rotten stench
from the Tomb Labyrinth.

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:01.410
Oh, hell no!

00:16:01.410 --> 00:16:05.790
How cruel, repurposing
murdered children like this.

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:07.910
Are you going to be okay, Nemesis?

00:16:07.910 --> 00:16:11.700
I'm not scared--I'm seething with fury!

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:13.750
So am I.

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:17.830
Hey, Nemesis, what happens when an undead dies?

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:22.660
I don't know. But I do think
it's best to end their suffering.

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:24.450
Right... yeah.

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.950
I'm sorry.

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:53.830
You have slain over 100 Undead
of an appropriate level tier.

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:59.910
Fulfilling the conditions for the
Paladin job plus this kill count

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:04.330
grants you the active skill
Purifying Silverlight.

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:07.450
Thank you...

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:19.410
Master...

00:17:19.410 --> 00:17:25.580
Is this... this feeling--is this
what Hugo was trying to say?

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:32.200
Yes. If the Master of a Maiden believes
deep inside that this world isn't a game,

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:37.450
if the lives in this world have
the same awareness we do...

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:43.250
Then each life here in <i>Infinite</i>
<i>Dendrogram</i> will feel all too real.

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:47.580
All too real... You're probably right.

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:51.580
And it must be that much more painful here,

00:17:51.580 --> 00:17:54.160
where lives are lost far more
easily than in your world.

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:56.080
It is.

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:59.080
There must be players who've chosen
to leave <i>Infinite Dendrogram</i>

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:03.830
rather than experience these
feelings time and time again.

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:06.040
But I...

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:08.290
I'm not yet broken.

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:11.450
We still haven't rescued the surviving children.

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:14.330
I haven't kept my promise.

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:16.910
And more than anything,

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:22.950
I haven't punished the bastards
who made this happen!

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:24.580
Come on, Nemesis!

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:25.750
Right!

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:30.200
Intruders, eh?

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:33.370
Gouz can handle the Master aboveground.

00:18:33.370 --> 00:18:38.120
Meanwhile, I'll prepare to meet
the other Master here.

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:47.080
This would have been a lot easier
with your Embryo's skills.

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:52.160
I can't do that. That skill has to wait
till our plan is underway.

00:18:52.160 --> 00:18:53.160
So stubborn.

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:54.870
I'm aware.

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:04.580
Yowch, that hurts. And it's hot, too!

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:09.080
He's a tough one--far tougher than the rest.

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:12.540
Am I correct that you're the leader
of the Gouz-Maise Gang?

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:19.450
Yep. I'm its second leader,
the Strong Gladiator Gouz.

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:21.500
Hey, didja know?

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:25.540
Bad guys're the tastiest grown-ups.
Nice an' bitter.

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:30.330
Unfortunately, I'm a vegetarian.

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:38.370
Just look atcha, all busted up.
No way couldja beat me.

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:44.580
--Wha--?
--Nothin' doin'!

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:53.790
I misjudged him...

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:04.370
The skill, Hugo?

00:20:04.370 --> 00:20:07.950
Should I use it, or should I hold off?

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:11.950
At this rate, I'll never defeat
such a mighty foe.

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:17.870
If I use the skill...
But I can't--not to serve our plan.

00:20:17.870 --> 00:20:22.120
Should I run away to avoid
the penalty for dying?

00:20:22.120 --> 00:20:25.000
Boy, I sure am hungry.

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:27.910
Guess it's dessert time!

00:20:43.950 --> 00:20:49.160
Mmm, delish. But a little on the small side.

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:56.500
Hugo, the skill?

00:20:56.500 --> 00:20:59.290
You know the answer.

00:21:05.580 --> 00:21:07.870
Gouz!

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:12.250
Eh? Shouldn't you be asleep?

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:18.910
You're right: I've been sleeping.
Or only half awake.

00:21:18.910 --> 00:21:22.000
I can't use the skill because we have a plan.

00:21:22.000 --> 00:21:25.330
I'll run away now and avoid
the penalty--all for the plan.

00:21:25.330 --> 00:21:30.080
Ridiculous. That isn't me.

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:36.950
The me I've made that is Hugo Lesseps--
that's not who he is.

00:21:36.950 --> 00:21:41.330
And so... I'll make my anger known.

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:45.450
I hereby declare that I shall <i>not</i> forgive you!

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:50.540
Pretty rich, comin' from a Master whose
existence is all for fun and games!

00:21:50.540 --> 00:21:55.410
For the sin of killing these humans,
I will send you to hell.

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:58.500
And my hell will destroy you!

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:02.040
Oh, yeah? Well, bring it on!

00:22:02.040 --> 00:22:03.410
Cyco!

00:22:05.370 --> 00:22:08.450
Crest Disguise: Deactivate!

00:22:09.500 --> 00:22:10.700
What?!

00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:12.370
Let's do this, Cocytus!

00:22:12.370 --> 00:22:14.750
Yes, Master!

00:22:22.910 --> 00:22:28.540
This is my Embryo, Type Maiden-Chariot...

00:22:32.750 --> 00:22:34.750
...Cocytus!

00:22:34.750 --> 00:22:38.080
You're just showin' off!

00:22:38.080 --> 00:22:43.580
Abandon all hope, ye who enter here.

00:22:39.290 --> 00:22:43.580
"Abandon all hope, ye who enter here."

00:22:44.040 --> 00:22:45.830
La Porte de l'Enfer!

00:23:04.750 --> 00:23:06.000
They're alive.

00:23:06.000 --> 00:23:07.290
Master.

00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:21.620
Is this some kind of experiment?

00:23:21.620 --> 00:23:24.080
No point in wondering!

00:23:28.250 --> 00:23:29.830
Die.

00:23:44.200 --> 00:23:48.370
"Beyond the Radix Point"

00:23:45.200 --> 00:23:47.540
"Beyond the Radix Point."
